@startuml lld-us2-class
title LLD-US2 Confirm login with an OTP: class diagram
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
class OtpService <<service>> {
  - store: OtpStore
  + send(mobile)
  + check(id, otp): bool
}
class OtpStore <<repository>> {
  hash, expiresAt
}
class SmsGateway <<external>> {
  + send(no, text)
}
OtpService --> OtpStore
OtpService --> SmsGateway : sends
@enduml